1
00:00:00,410 --> 00:00:03,550
(chuckles) Small world.

2
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:04,720
(Priya:)You did talk to her, didn't you?

3
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:07,320
(Leonard:)Of course, I did.
I talked and talked and talked.

4
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:12,420
(Penny:)Hey! Look at Leonard
in his fancy-ass
grownup clothes.

5
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:16,090
(Penny:)Way to go, Priya.
For once, he doesn't look

6
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,430
(Penny:)like a mannequin in
the boys' department.

7
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,200
(chuckles)
Hey, did he

8
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,970
(Penny:)tell you I saved
the silk shirt?

9
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:24,340
(Priya:)No, he did not.

10
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:26,440
(Penny:)He was gonna throw it
in the washing machine

11
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:29,140
(Penny:)with his
Spiderman underwear.

12
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,910
(Penny:)That's our Lenny, huh?
(laughs)

13
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:33,880
(Priya:)Yes, that's our Lenny.

14
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:36,130
(Penny:)So how's
the food here?

15
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:39,000
(Penny:)Oh, wow, that is
really, really good.

16
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,000
(Penny:)Oh, I'm sorry.
You guys are on a date.

17
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,920
(Penny:)We can hang out
anytime. Have fun.

18
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:44,260
(Leonard:)Bye.
Good night.

19
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:47,590
(Penny:)Oh, that's, hot, hot, hot, hot!

20
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:52,680
(Penny:)Whoo! It really
sneaks up on ya, huh?

21
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:54,100
(Penny:)All right, I gotta go.

22
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:04,020
(Leonard:)It is pretty spicy.

